        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "The primary influence is International Style typography and grids, with Art Deco as a secondary influence. The visual vocabulary is Swiss grids, blueprints, and rectangular forms with no rounded corners. Water and the ocean are a recurring theme. The only texture is an ordered dither.",
